    <profileDesc>
      <abstract>
        <p>We forecast LME copper prices using an LSTM with attention and beat ARIMA baselines on daily data.</p>
      </abstract>
    </profileDesc>
  </teiHeader>
  <text xml:lang="en">
    <body>
      <div>
        <head>Introduction</head>
        <p>Commodity price forecasting is hard. Prior work used ARIMA and VAR models.</p>
        <p>We propose a deep learning approach.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Methodology</head>
        <p>We train an LSTM with an attention mechanism on daily LME copper prices from 2000 to 2023.</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <head>Results</head>
        <p>Our model achieves an RMSE of 0.12, outperforming the ARIMA baseline at 0.21.</p>
      </div>
    </body>
